背景加载完事件，示例代码：
```html
<script type="text/javascript" src="http://catmull.uk/downloads/bg-loaded/bg-loaded.js"></script>
<script type="text/javascript">
   $('body').bgLoaded({
      afterLoaded : function() {
         alert('Background image done loading');
      }
   });
</script>
```
